        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Geoffrey Wright, Brittany Murphy, Jay Mohr, Michael Biehn, Russell Crowe, Natalie Ramsey\n- Works: Cherry Falls, Romper Stomper, Cruel Intentions 3, Pleasantville\n- Topics: film directing, acting\n\nFacts:\n- Geoffrey Wright was born in 1959 and is an Australian film director and screenwriter.\n- Geoffrey Wright gained cult success with the 1992 film Romper Stomper, which starred Russell Crowe.\n- Cherry Falls is a 2000 American slasher film directed by Geoffrey Wright.\n- Cherry Falls stars Brittany Murphy, Jay Mohr, and Michael Biehn.\n- Natalie Ramsey has starred in Cruel Intentions 3, Cherry Falls, and Pleasantville.",
